# The ARM file for the Equity EDA-1 REAL-MONEY VALIDATION runtime.
#
# THIS FILE MUST NOT EXIST ON A HOST THAT IS NOT DELIBERATELY ARMED.
#
# Install to /etc/autotrader/autotrader-equity-live.arm.env only as the
# deliberate act of arming, and delete it to disarm. The unit loads it after
# autotrader-equity-live.env, so this overrides the safe default there. Its
# absence on a freshly deployed host leaves the safe default standing rather
# than failing the unit: the gate fails closed at the deployment layer for the
# same reason it fails closed in code.
#
# Deleting this file is the environment half of the off switch. The other half
# is the durable row, and either one alone is enough to stop submission - which
# is the point of having two.
#
# Arming the environment does NOT arm the runtime. The operational store must
# also carry an ARMED row, written with an explicit confirmation token and a
# recorded reason. A host with this file and an unarmed store submits nothing.

AUTOTRADER_LIVE_ARMED=true
